# Line endings — see README.md "Repository layout".
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true. Without this file, a fresh clone checks text files out as
# CRLF, while scripts/build.py always writes LF — so validate.py's "byte-identical rebuild" check
# would compare CRLF (working copy) against LF (fresh build) and fail spuriously.
#
# Rule: everything is LF inside the repository *and* on disk; Windows batch files are the one
# exception, because cmd.exe is only reliable with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
